## Cross-cutting facts

- All `.done` markers in `workspace/` live in `phase-01`..`phase-16`, `phase-18`..`phase-20`, plus `phase-35`..`phase-42` (verified by directory listing). No `.deferred`/`.blocked`/`.attempts`/`.no_work`/`.session` markers exist anywhere. `phase-39`, `phase-40`, `phase-41` and `phase-42` also ship their PROMPT-required `REPORT.md`.
  - **2026-08-15 (phase-32 review fix): `workspace/phase-32/.done` was removed — a false completion (marked `.done` with no code/docs/findings; commits `1ce5a44` reset + `6b17422` re-added). `scripts/phase_runner.sh` now gates `.done` on a working-tree evidence check (changes outside `logs/` + the phase's own markers), so a phase can no longer self-certify DONE with only logs; a zero-work run is counted as a failed attempt and leaves a `.no_work` marker for diagnosis.**
  - **2026-08-15 (phase-32 already-done guard): commits `44a7210`+`27b93fd` re-selected the completed phase-32 and left contradictory `.no_work`/`.deferred`/`.deferred_attempts`/`.session` alongside its legitimate `.done`. `phase_runner.sh` now short-circuits normal-run mode when `.done` exists and clears those stale markers; the stale phase-32 markers were removed here so select-phase stops re-selecting it.**
  - **2026-08-15 (phase-42 review fix): commit `65bf35e` re-added stale `.no_work`/`.deferred`/`.deferred_attempts`/`.session` markers alongside phase-42's legitimate `.done` (the phase-32 scenario again). Removed here; only `.done` remains. See `workspace/phase-42/REPORT.md` Addendum 2.**
- `phase-17` is the only phase whose directory no longer exists (deleted 4112eb8) and is therefore marked `CANCELLED` and excluded from heading marking.
- ROADMAP/workspace numbering differ: workspace `phase-NN` (audit pipeline) ≠ ROADMAP `PHASE N` (app feature roadmap). Do not confuse them.
- `phase-20` (this doc-fix) is `DONE`; `phase-21`..`phase-29` have PROMPT.md only — no implementation, no marker.
- Sources: `workspace/phase-14/AUDIT_REPORT.md`, `workspace/phase-08/PERF_REPORT.md`, `ROADMAP.md` POST-AUDIT TRUTH TABLE + per-phase checklists, git history (`git log -S` / `git show --stat`), direct source inspection.

